  "description": "ThinkGeo.Printers holds the GDI+ printing path for ThinkGeo page layouts. PrinterGeoCanvas is what sends a layout to a Windows printer and is fully supported; the *PrinterLayer classes beside it are deprecated and will be removed after v15.4, superseded by the PrinterLayout family in ThinkGeo.Core, which composes the same layouts, draws on this same canvas for printing, and also exports vector PDF through PdfGeoCanvas on Windows, Linux and macOS.",
